    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know why im still trying anymore. everything feels so heavy and i feel like i'm just dragging everyone down with me. my family, my friends... they'd be so much better off if they didnt have to deal with my constant mess. i'm just a burden to everyone.",
